    {
      "id": "bios.bin",
      "display": "PlayStation 2 BIOS",
      "description": "The firmware of the DVD PLAYER. It is not a boot ROM, and a machine does not start from it. It is listed only for completeness. If the machine does not start, this is the reason. This project asks for DVD player v3.11. The file is usually called ps2-dvd-311.bin. Another copy of the same version is accepted. A different version is a different machine, and you choose it with the Boot ROM setting.",
